{"id":"641829","name":"粉条白菜拌鸡胸肉","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/641829/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜芯","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"若干"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"取鸡胸肉冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/641829/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"两面烫变色即可。","img":"images/641829/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净浮沫放砂锅里，加清水，炖排骨的砂锅，直接炖鸡胸肉。","img":"images/641829/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"大火烧开，改中火炖40分钟即可。","img":"images/641829/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"粉条洗净冷水下锅。","img":"images/641829/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮熟。","img":"images/641829/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出放大碗里。","img":"images/641829/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取白菜芯。","img":"images/641829/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切细丝。","img":"images/641829/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取鸡胸肉，拍一拍，撕成条。","img":"images/641829/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"香菜洗净切段，所有食材放一起。","img":"images/641829/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大蒜去皮洗净放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/641829/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"捣成蒜泥放陈醋和生抽。","img":"images/641829/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放麻酱。","img":"images/641829/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放香油。","img":"images/641829/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放腐乳汁拌匀。","img":"images/641829/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放鸡汤。","img":"images/641829/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/641829/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"麻汁放菜里拌匀即可。","img":"images/641829/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}